# local-only prose
#
# Untracked, not deleted: all three stay on disk for whoever is working in this tree. CLAUDE.md is
# the process doc and TODO.md the board — neither says anything to somebody who clones this, and both
# churn every session. docs/ is the annotated screenshot sheet, a 0.16.0-era artefact that ages faster
# than the code it shows. Git history keeps the versions that were tracked until 1.0.0.
CLAUDE.md
TODO.md
docs/
